     3630   .
     3631   DEFINE QUERY br-list FOR gds-list SCROLLING.
     3632   DEFINE BROWSE br-list QUERY br-list NO-LOCK DISPLAY
     3633         gds-list.to-sel  format "+/" column-label "*"
     3634         gds-list.gds-code FORMAT "99999999999":U
     3635         gds-list.artic
