    10703                                           ,input v-sel-obj-code
    10704                                           ,input-output vvalue
    10705                                           ,output v-setted) no-error .
    10706         end.
    10707         else do:
    10708           run  value(v-spr)
    10709                         in this-procedure (
    10710                                           input 0
